Notes on third-party components:

1. Benchmark vulnerability cases in `01_benchmark_annotations/` are derived
   in part from the published BACFuzz and BolaZ works. Please cite those
   original works, in addition to this artifact and the associated thesis /
   JISA manuscript, when reusing the benchmark annotations.

2. The Longformer model architecture used in `03_notebooks/` and described
   by the configuration files in `05_tokenizer_phase3_final/` is subject to
   its own upstream license from its original publisher/model card. No
   fine-tuned model weights are redistributed in this repository; only the
   tokenizer/config files needed to reconstruct the input pipeline are
   included.

3. Any third-party libraries imported by the notebooks (e.g. Hugging Face
   Transformers, PyTorch) retain their own respective licenses and are not
   redistributed here.
